    <h3>LLM Txt Generator: Does the File Do Anything?</h3>
    <p>It is a voluntary convention, and not every AI system reads it. Google says llms.txt files do not positively or negatively impact visibility or rankings in Google Search, though it is fine to keep one for other services that use them.</p>
