    <p>A humans.txt file is a different convention, usually a credits note about the people who built a site. llms.txt is a summary written for AI tools. This generator makes llms.txt only.</p>
    <h3>LLMs Text Generator vs robots.txt and sitemap.xml</h3>
    <p>robots.txt sets which pages crawlers may access, and a sitemap lists URLs for search engines. llms.txt controls no access. Build the other two with our <a href="/tools/robots-txt-generator">robots.txt generator</a> and <a href="/tools/sitemap-generator">sitemap generator</a>.</p>
